      "worked": "The fourth row of Pascal’s triangle is $1,4,6,4,1$.\n$$\\begin{align*}1+\\sqrt2+\\sqrt3+\\sqrt6&=(1+\\sqrt2)(1+\\sqrt3)\\\\(1+\\sqrt2)^4&=1+4\\sqrt2+6(\\sqrt2)^2+4(\\sqrt2)^3+(\\sqrt2)^4\\\\(1+\\sqrt2)^4&=17+12\\sqrt2\\\\(1+\\sqrt3)^4&=1+4\\sqrt3+6(\\sqrt3)^2+4(\\sqrt3)^3+(\\sqrt3)^4\\\\(1+\\sqrt3)^4&=28+16\\sqrt3\\\\(1+\\sqrt2+\\sqrt3+\\sqrt6)^4&=(17+12\\sqrt2)(28+16\\sqrt3)\\\\(1+\\sqrt2+\\sqrt3+\\sqrt6)^4&=476+336\\sqrt2+272\\sqrt3+192\\sqrt6\\end{align*}$$\nThus $a=476$, $b=336$, $c=272$ and $d=192$.",
